  <div class="phys-intro">
    <strong>How to use this panel:</strong> Each card is a hormone, enzyme cascade, or regulatory loop. Check it off as you add it to your map. For each one, your map should show the <span style="background:#E8F5E9;color:#2E6B3E;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78em;">ON</span> stimulus, the <span style="background:var(--teal-light);color:#1A5958;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78em;">EFFECT</span>, and the <span style="background:#FDE8E8;color:#7B2020;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.78em;">OFF</span> signal. A tiny labeled loop is enough -- no paragraphs needed.
